  "details": "The new menu is nice. But, I would absolutely love if I could make it and its text a bit bigger. I've already been having an issue with not being able to read the current nameplates, even on their largest setting. My glasses don't fit in my headset and I really can't afford the fit-in prescription lenses or anything. All last night I was shoving my menu in my face because I couldn't hardly read most of it and it was fairly obnoxious. Pretty much my only complaint is just how small it is with no option to increase the size.",
